{% if collection.handle == 'sets' %}
{%- liquid
  assign set_handles = 'suiji-rpt-set-01-dual-back-stud,suiji-rpt-set-02-stud-collar-ring,suiji-rpt-set-03-stud-ring,suiji-rpt-set-04-collar-charm,suiji-rpt-set-05-collar-hoop,suiji-rpt-set-06-collar-hoop-ring,suiji-rpt-set-07-chain-hoop,suiji-rpt-set-08-chain-hoop-ring,suiji-rpt-set-09-chain-ring' | split: ','
  assign locale = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first
  if locale != 'fr'
    assign locale = 'en'
  endif
-%}
<div class="r-site suiji-set-listing" data-r107-page data-family="sets">
  <header class="r-intro r-intro--small">
    {% if locale == 'fr' %}
      <h1>Ensembles</h1>
      <p>Découvrez le contenu de chaque ensemble. Les photos présentent une sélection de composants.</p>
    {% else %}
      <h1>Sets</h1>
      <p>See what comes with each set. The photos show selected components.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </header>
  {%- assign listed = 0 -%}
  <div class="suiji-set-grid" data-quote-sets>
    {% for handle in set_handles %}
      {% assign set_product = all_products[handle] %}
      {% assign quote = set_product.metafields.custom.suiji_set_quote.value %}
      {% if set_product != blank and quote != blank and set_product.media.size > 0 %}
        {% assign listed = listed | plus: 1 %}
        {% assign loading = 'lazy' %}
        {% if listed <= 3 %}{% assign loading = 'eager' %}{% endif %}
        <article class="suiji-set-card" data-quote-set="{{ quote.code | escape }}">
          <a class="suiji-set-card__link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/products/' | append: set_product.handle | replace: '//', '/' }}">
            <div class="suiji-set-card__images{% if set_product.media.size > 1 %} suiji-set-card__images--pair{% endif %}">
              {% for photo in set_product.media limit: 2 %}
                {{ photo.preview_image | image_url: width: 680 | image_tag: widths: '250, 360, 480, 680', sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 20vw, (min-width: 591px) 28vw, 70vw', alt: '', loading: loading, decoding: 'async' }}
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <h2 class="suiji-set-card__title">{{ quote.title[locale] | escape }}</h2>
            <p class="suiji-set-card__price" data-set-price>{{ set_product.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</p>
          </a>
        </article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if listed == 0 %}
    <p>{% if locale == 'fr' %}Nos ensembles sont en préparation.{% else %}Our sets are in preparation.{% endif %}</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% else %}
{% if request.page_type == 'collection' and collection.all_products_count == 0 %}
  <div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="sets">
    <header class="r-intro r-intro--small">
      {% if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr' %}
        <h1>Ensembles</h1>
        <h2>Nos ensembles sont en préparation</h2>
        <p>Nous préparons les photos et vérifions le contenu de chaque ensemble. Découvrez comment associer les pièces.</p>
        <a class="r-button r-button--line" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/editions' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Voir les associations</a>
      {% else %}
        <h1>Sets</h1>
        <h2>Our sets are in preparation</h2>
        <p>We’re preparing the photography and checking what comes with each set. Explore how the pieces can be combined.</p>
        <a class="r-button r-button--line" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/editions' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Explore combinations</a>
      {% endif %}
    </header>
  </div>
{% else %}
{%- if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr' -%}
<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="sets" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Ensembles</h1><p>Découvrez les compositions possibles, puis vérifiez le contenu exact. Les images présentent différentes utilisations des éléments, pas un ornement distinct pour chaque emplacement.</p></header><div class="r-catalogue" data-catalogue><div class="r-filter-bar"><button class="r-button r-button--line" data-open-filters>Filtrer <span data-filter-count></span></button><p data-result-count></p><label>Trier <select data-sort><option value="original">Sélection</option><option value="name">Nom A–Z</option></select></label></div><div class="r-catalogue__layout"><dialog class="r-filters" id="r-filters" aria-labelledby="r-filter-title"><div class="r-filters__head"><h2 id="r-filter-title">Votre sélection</h2><button data-close-filters aria-label="Fermer les filtres">×</button></div><fieldset><legend>Type de pièce</legend></fieldset><button class="r-link" data-clear-filters>Effacer les filtres</button></dialog><div class="r-results"><div class="r-grid "></div><div class="r-empty" data-no-results hidden><h2>Aucune pièce ne correspond à ces choix.</h2><p>Aucune pièce ne correspond à ces choix. Effacez les filtres ou dites-nous ce que vous recherchez.</p><button class="r-button" data-clear-filters>Effacer les filtres</button></div></div></div></div><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Quelques repères</h2></div><p>Vous hésitez sur les éléments nécessaires ? Découvrez comment les bases et les ornements s’assemblent.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/bases' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Bases et éléments<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><aside class="r-reading"><p class="r-eyebrow">Pour aller plus loin</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/blogs/journal/interchangeable-or-fixed-jewelry' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Bijou transformable ou pièces séparées : que choisir selon vos habitudes ?<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></aside></section></div>
{%- else -%}
<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="sets" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Sets</h1><p>See the complete looks a set can create, then check exactly what is included. Rotation images show different ways to use the parts, not a separate charm for every position.</p></header><div class="r-catalogue" data-catalogue><div class="r-filter-bar"><button class="r-button r-button--line" data-open-filters>Filter <span data-filter-count></span></button><p data-result-count></p><label>Sort <select data-sort><option value="original">Selection</option><option value="name">Name A–Z</option></select></label></div><div class="r-catalogue__layout"><dialog class="r-filters" id="r-filters" aria-labelledby="r-filter-title"><div class="r-filters__head"><h2 id="r-filter-title">Your selection</h2><button data-close-filters aria-label="Close filters">×</button></div><fieldset><legend>Piece type</legend></fieldset><button class="r-link" data-clear-filters>Clear filters</button></dialog><div class="r-results"><div class="r-grid "></div><div class="r-empty" data-no-results hidden><h2>Nothing matches these choices.</h2><p>No pieces match these choices. Clear the filters, or tell us what you are looking for.</p><button class="r-button" data-clear-filters>Clear filters</button></div></div></div></div><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>A little guidance</h2></div><p>Not sure which parts you need? See how bases and charms connect.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/bases' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Bases &amp; components<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><aside class="r-reading"><p class="r-eyebrow">A useful next read</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/blogs/journal/interchangeable-or-fixed-jewelry' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Convertible jewelry or separate pieces: which suits your habits?<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></aside></section></div>
{%- endif -%}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
